 the  interplanetary wars  end a united earth government is formed  but they are now facing problems of  overpopulation famine  and economic instability caused by the  wars  with now over 800 settled worlds across  the milky way galaxy  humanity's golden age of expansion was  about to come to an end  but with its rapid spread the outer less  wealthy colonies  began to feel isolated laws and taxes  set up by the united earth governments  were causing dissent  and instability against the centralized  earth government  outer colonies were feeling like it was  becoming their role to work hard  and live in squalor in order for the  wealthy inner colonies  to continue their more luxurious  lifestyles  this eventually led to the insurrection  an undeclared civil war  between the unsc and the various rebel  groups that rose up against it  the insurrection led to the unsc to  create the spartan 2 project  this program would take 75 physically  and mentally gifted children  into rigorous training and physical  augmentations through surgical and  medical means  these super soldiers codenamed spartans  were given the task  of squashing the rebellion because time  was a factor  but also the need to maintain secrecy  around the program  these 75 children were kidnapped and  replaced with flash clones  who would die shortly after once the  children had met physical maturity  the biological augmentation process  would begin  this part of the program was tough and  almost immediately  30 of them died as a result of the  procedure with a further 12 of the  candidates  being left permanently crippled  first contact between humanity and the  covenant is made  the prophets discover that the humans  were pretty much the living ears to the  ones the covenant worship as gods  the foreigners realizing that this will  pose a threat to their authority as well  as their religion  they hide the truth from the rest of the  covenant and call for the complete  destruction of all humanity  claiming